"description" = "MVM Fitness — Me vs Me. Train like a military service member. See where you stand.\n\nTrain against your toughest competitor: yourself. MVM Fitness is a personal strength and conditioning tracker built around one idea — every workout is a chance to beat your last one.\n\nTrack what matters\nLog lifts, sets, reps, and cardio in seconds. Clean, fast entry designed for the gym floor, not a spreadsheet. Your full history is always a tap away.\n\nSee real progress\nVisualize volume, PRs, streaks, and trends over time. Compare this week to last, this month to last month, and watch the curve climb.\n\nApple Intelligence insights (iOS 26)\nOn supported devices, on-device AI surfaces personal performance insights automatically — where you're improving, where you're plateauing, and what to focus on next. Everything stays private on your device.\n\nApple Watch companion\nStart, track, and finish workouts right from your wrist. Heart rate, timers, and set logging sync seamlessly back to your iPhone.\n\nBuilt for iPhone and iPad\nFull native experience on both, with a Liquid Glass interface that feels right at home on iOS 26.\n\nAlso included\n\nCustom workout plans and routines\nExercise library with form cues\nRest timers and set tracking\nProgress photos and body metrics\nFull offline support — your data, on your device\nNo ads. No noise. Just you vs. you.\n\nDownload MVM Fitness today. The mission demands fitness — and this is how you build it.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://m5cairo.com/portfolio/mvm-fitness/privacy-policy/\nApple EULA: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/ \nAccessibility: https://m5cairo.com/portfolio/mvm-fitness/accessibility/\nDisclaimer:https://m5cairo.com/portfolio/mvm-fitness/disclaimer/\nRisks:https://m5cairo.com/portfolio/mvm-fitness/risks/";
